sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Eval controller
    participant E as Environment / device
    participant H as Ordinary Harness
    participant S as Independent scorer
    participant R as Results / evidence
    C->>R: Freeze code, task, model, skills, budgets
    C->>E: Initialize official task and start state
    E-->>C: Initialization result or environment fault
    C->>H: Run ordinary task, without scoring answers
    H->>E: Observations, actions and feedback
    H->>R: Persist roles, receipts, usage and trace
    H-->>C: Return runtime verdict
    C->>S: Request independent correctness check
    S->>E: Read protocol-defined final state
    E-->>S: Return app state and scoring evidence
    S->>R: Save official score or unscored reason
    C->>E: Cleanup; record teardown separately
